></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A hidden room (Extra) will be available after the Normal or True end.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A new outfit for Amelia will be available for the second run :D</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Steam Achievements</li></ul><br><br>Original music in the trailer: &quot;Halloween&quot; by Zephysonas<br>Special Thanks: SophiaSW, Duelist",
